# Copy to ".env" (gitignored) and fill in what you use.

# The web app does NOT read LLM keys from here: users enter them in Settings and
# they stay on-device, so secrets never end up in a build.

# Developer-only: tools/make-sample-vault.mjs uses this to embed the synthetic
# sample vault. The generated vault is committed; normal app use does not need it.
OPENAI_API_KEY=

# --- Dropbox app key: read by the WEB APP as a fallback ---
# NOT a secret in the PKCE public-client flow, so it's safe to read/bundle. Set
# it here to connect sync without pasting the key in Settings each install.
# Create an app at https://www.dropbox.com/developers/apps
DROPBOX_APP_KEY=
